		"description": "# Summary\n\nThis collection contains example API requests for both the User and SleepSession controllers of the sleep-api application. This includes both successful requests as well as requests that cause an exception that will be handled by the sleep-api.\n\n_\\*Note: I inserted some dummy test data in one of the flyway migration files for testing the api. The requests in this collection are meant to use this data._\n\n## Endpoints\n\nThe User endpoint is: **/user/{id}**\n\nThe single SleepSession endpoint is: **/user/{id}/sleep**\n\nThe 30 day SleepHistory endpoint is: **/user/{id}/sleep-history**\n\n## Postman Collection Structure\n\nThe Collection is organized by Controller -> Response Code",
